        },
        {
          "text": "Mpawo mwami Zedekiya wakalailila kuti babike Jeremiya mulubuwa lwabalindizi, nkabela wakapegwa cinkwa comwe abuzuba kuzwa kumugwagwa wabasikujika mazuba oonse zilyo zyamumunzi nizyatakalina kumaninina. Mbuboobo Jeremiya mbwaakakala mulubuwa lwabalindizi.",
